{"author":{"id":"b409816c5cd5ab140d1d52eb33aace35de44952bb794b19806fd57f6ecb1ace9"},"ops":[{"type":1,"timestamp":1791542549,"nonce":"ucm9pQ2TBQPiAITbtzYUvcUNJkY=","title":"Cranelift: emit scalar global initializers","message":"CraneliftBackend::define_global emits zero-initialized storage for any HirGlobal initializer other than String or VTable. A mutable I64 global initialized with HirConstant::I64(23) is therefore zero when compiled with TieredRuntime::compile_module. The same issue affects constant numeric globals without a synthesized initialization function. Emit scalar integer, floating-point and null initializers in the target representation, and verify the stored bytes across Cranelift, interpreter bindings and LLVM. Discovered while validating pending-error metadata; not required for the flag hookup fix.","files":null}]}